flowchart LR
  developer[Developer with an existing Git repository] -->|runs| setup[Windows PowerShell setup]
  setup -->|calls Python| cli[Starter CLI]
  cli -->|preserve and merge| adapter[AGENTS.md and selected agent adapter]
  cli -->|register| memory[Ignored registry, project cards and hubs]
  cli -->|export only| clean[Allowlisted clean starter]
  cli -->|explicit reset only| backup[Back up all supported local agent instructions and skills]
  backup -->|after every backup succeeds| clear[Clear supported paths and configure selected agent]
  subgraph optional[Optional graph tooling - invoked separately]
    graphify[Manual Graphify AST update] --> graph[MyOS graph.json]
    recall[Local graph recall] -->|reads| graph
  end
